        "title": "Teleconnections - ENSO, NAO, MJO, PDO, AO",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Teleconnections are statistical relationships between climate anomalies in geographically remote regions. They reflect coherent large-scale patterns of atmospheric or ocean-atmosphere variability that modulate weather patterns globally — the primary source of seasonal-scale predictability beyond the 2-week weather forecast limit."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-TELECONNECTIONS.md#003",
